  "Si y_p résout L(y) = b, alors y_h + y_p résout L(y) = b pour toute solution y_h de L(y) = 0.": "If y_p solves L(y) = b, then y_h + y_p solves L(y) = b for every solution y_h of L(y) = 0.",
